# Local Terraform working data and credentials
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/tfplan
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/override.tf
**/*_override.tf
**/crash.log
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc

# Authentication files and execution output
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.retry
**/.vault-password*
**/vault_password*
**/secrets.yml
**/secrets.yaml
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/kubeconfig*
**/admin.conf
**/auth.json

# Keep the provider dependency lock file in version control.
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
